# 触摸丢点诊断开关；仅排查构建启用，正式版保持关闭。
# Touch tap-drop diagnostics; enable only on investigation builds.
menu "Touch diagnostics"

    config TOUCH_DIAG
        bool "Enable touch tap-drop diagnostics logging"
        default n
        help
            阅读翻页偶发无响应排查用：在触摸输入链路（app_loop / ui_gesture /
            app_book / cst836u）输出单行事件日志、阻塞窗口与统计汇总。
            Investigation aid for sporadic dropped page-turn taps: one-line
            event logs, stall windows and stats on the touch input chain.

    config TOUCH_DIAG_BEEP
        bool "Beep when an input event is discarded without action"
        depends on TOUCH_DIAG
        default n
        help
            手势被取消或双击挂起被冲销时短鸣一声，便于不接串口时统计丢失率。
            Short beep when a gesture is cancelled or a pending double-tap is
            dropped, so drop rates can be counted without a serial console.

endmenu

# bring-up 阶段的面板自检；正式固件保持关闭。
# Panel self-test for bring-up; keep disabled in production images.
menu "Bring-up diagnostics"

    config MOGO_EPD_TEST_PATTERN
        bool "Run EPD test pattern at boot"
        default n
        help
            开机先画灰阶条、棋盘格、细线、四角十字、中心圆和 1 px 边框，
            再做一次 GC16 全刷与 20 次 GL16 局刷，最后停 10 秒。
            Draw gray bars, checkerboard, thin lines, corner crosses, a center
            circle and a 1 px border, then one GC16 full refresh and 20 GL16
            area updates, holding the pattern for 10 seconds.

endmenu
